<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>tap strafe left 180</Major>
    <Description>to use this macro your jump must be binded to scroll wheel down and forward to scroll wheel up.

1 reach full speed whilst running.
2 press the desired macro button and a slide will happen
3 flick camera to your left after you have jumped and you will do a full 180.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 27 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 36 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 13 ms
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 4 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>